"<br>\n"
"Example: 'my good file.ext' becomes 'mygoodfile.ext'\n"
"<p><b>Extended Strip</b>"
"<br>\n"
"If this option is checked K3b will remove all spaces in all filenames and "
"capitalize all letters following a space."
